
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#080808">
<title>KB | Rocket League Sideswipe</title>

<style>
:root {
  --red: #ed1c2e;
  --bg: #080808;
  --panel: #141414;
  --text: #fff;
  --muted: #999;
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }

nav {
  height: 75px;
  padding: 0 7%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  background: #090909;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #292929;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 99;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 30px;
  font-weight: 1000;
  letter-spacing: 5px;
}

.logo span { color: var(--red); }

.navlinks {
  display: flex;
  gap: 25px;
}

.navlinks a {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #ddd;
  transition: .2s;
}

.navlinks a:hover { color: var(--red); }

.menu {
  display: none;
  border: 0;
  background: transparent;
  color: white;
  font-size: 28px;
}

.hero {
  min-height: 650px;
  padding: 80px 20px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #570c14 0%, #1a080a 38%, #080808 78%);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.eyebrow {
  color: var(--red);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: bold;
  letter-spacing: 7px;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(100px, 22vw, 190px);
  font-weight: 1000;
  letter-spacing: 15px;
  margin: 10px 0;
  text-shadow: 0 0 55px #ed1c2e55;
}

.hero h1 span { color: var(--red); }

.hero h2 {
  font-size: 19px;
  letter-spacing: 5px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.hero p {
  color: #aaa;
  margin-bottom: 35px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.buttons {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 16px 28px;
  background: var(--red);
  color: white;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: bold;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  border: 1px solid var(--red);
  border-radius: 3px;
  transition: .2s;
}

.btn:hover {
  background: #b90e1c;
  transform: translateY(-3px);
}

.btn.secondary {
  background: transparent;
  border-color: #555;
}

section { padding: 85px 8%; }

.heading {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 45px;
}

.heading .small {
  color: var(--red);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: bold;
  letter-spacing: 5px;
}

.heading h2 {
  font-size: 37px;
  margin-top: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.heading h2 span { color: var(--red); }

.heading p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 13px;
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.about {
  background: #111;
  text-align: center;
}

.about-content {
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: auto;
  color: #bbb;
  line-height: 2;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.divisions {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 15px;
  margin: 45px auto 0;
  max-width: 800px;
}

.division {
  padding: 25px 10px;
  background: #1b1b1b;
  border-bottom: 3px solid var(--red);
}

.division h3 {
  font-size: 28px;
  color: var(--red);
}

.division p {
  color: #999;
  font-size: 10px;
  margin-top: 8px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.roster { background: #080808; }

.teams {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 25px;
}

.team {
  background: var(--panel);
  border: 1px solid #292929;
  border-radius: 6px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.team-header {
  padding: 25px;
  background: linear-gradient(120deg, #3b090e, #171010);
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--red);
}

.team-header h3 {
  font-size: 27px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.team-header h3 span { color: var(--red); }

.team-header p {
  color: #aaa;
  font-size: 11px;
  margin-top: 8px;
}

.team-body { padding: 20px; }

.player {
  padding: 16px 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #292929;
  font-size: 13px;
}

.player:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

.player span:last-child {
  color: var(--red);
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

.empty {
  padding: 20px 0;
  color: #777;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.recruitment {
  text-align: center;
  background: linear-gradient(120deg, #33090e, #130809, #080808);
}

.recruitment p {
  color: #bbb;
  line-height: 1.9;
  max-width: 550px;
  margin: 15px auto 30px;
}

.clips {
  text-align: center;
  background: #111;
}

.clips p, .discord p {
  color: #999;
  margin: 15px auto 30px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.discord { text-align: center; }

footer {
  padding: 35px 15px;
  text-align: center;
  background: #050505;
  border-top: 1px solid #292929;
  color: #777;
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 2;
}

footer strong {
  color: var(--red);
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-size: 18px;
}

@media(max-width: 700px) {
  nav { padding: 0 6%; }
  .menu { display: block; }

  .navlinks {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    top: 74px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    background: #101010;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 25px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
  }

  .navlinks.open { display: flex; }

  .hero { min-height: 570px; }
  .hero h1 { letter-spacing: 7px; }
  .hero h2 { font-size: 15px; }

  section { padding: 65px 6%; }
  .teams { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .divisions { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .heading h2 { font-size: 29px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
  <a class="logo" href="#home">K<span>B</span></a>

  <button class="menu" onclick="toggleMenu()">☰</button>

  <div class="navlinks" id="navlinks">
    <a href="#home" onclick="closeMenu()">HOME</a>
    <a href="#about" onclick="closeMenu()">ABOUT</a>
    <a href="#roster" onclick="closeMenu()">ROSTER</a>
    <a href="#recruitment" onclick="closeMenu()">JOIN KB</a>
    <a href="#clips" onclick="closeMenu()">CLIPS</a>
    <a href="#discord" onclick="closeMenu()">DISCORD</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO THE OFFICIAL</div>
  <h1>K<span>B</span></h1>
  <h2>ROCKET LEAGUE SIDESWIPE</h2>
  <p>BUILT TO COMPETE. UNITED AS ONE.</p>

  <div class="buttons">
    <a href="#roster" class="btn">EXPLORE THE ROSTER</a>
    <a href="https://discord.gg/ZnfGRUM6j"
       target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn secondary">
       JOIN OUR DISCORD
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="heading">
    <div class="small">WHO WE ARE</div>
    <h2>ABOUT <span>KB</span></h2>
    <p>THE COMMUNITY BEHIND THE NAME</p>
  </div>

  <p class="about-content">
    Welcome to KB, a Rocket League Sideswipe community
    bringing players together from around the world.
    Whether you're competing, improving your skills,
    finding teammates or sharing your best clips,
    KB is where the community comes together.
  </p>

  <div class="divisions">
    <div class="division">
      <h3>EU</h3>
      <p>EUROPE</p>
    </div>
    <div class="division">
      <h3>NA</h3>
      <p>NORTH AMERICA</p>
    </div>
    <div class="division">
      <h3>KB</h3>
      <p>ONE COMMUNITY</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="roster" id="roster">
  <div class="heading">
    <div class="small">MEET THE PLAYERS</div>
    <h2>THE <span>ROSTER</span></h2>
    <p>REPRESENTING KB ACROSS THE WORLD</p>
  </div>

  <div class="teams">

    <div class="team">
      <div class="team-header">
        <h3><span>EU</span> DIVISION</h3>
        <p>EUROPEAN TEAM</p>
      </div>
      <div class="team-body">
        <div class="empty">
          Official EU roster will be announced here.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="team">
      <div class="team-header">
        <h3><span>NA</span> DIVISION</h3>
        <p>NORTH AMERICAN TEAM</p>
      </div>
      <div class="team-body">
        <div class="empty">
          Official NA roster will be announced here.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="recruitment" id="recruitment">
  <div class="heading">
    <div class="small">YOUR NEXT STEP</div>
    <h2>JOIN <span>KB</span></h2>
    <p>READY TO BECOME PART OF THE COMMUNITY?</p>
  </div>

  <p>
    Interested in joining KB? Visit our Discord server
    to meet the community, learn about recruitment
    and find out how to get involved.
  </p>

  <a href="https://discord.gg/ZnfGRUM6j"
     target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">
     JOIN KB & FIND OUT MORE
  </a>
</section>

<section class="clips" id="clips">
  <div class="heading">
    <div class="small">COMMUNITY CONTENT</div>
    <h2>KB <span>HIGHLIGHTS</span></h2>
    <p>THE MOMENTS THAT MAKE THE COMMUNITY</p>
  </div>

  <p>Player clips, goals and highlights coming soon.</p>

  <a href="https://discord.gg/ZnfGRUM6j"
     target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">
     SHARE YOUR CLIPS
  </a>
</section>

<section class="discord" id="discord">
  <div class="heading">
    <div class="small">STAY CONNECTED</div>
    <h2>JOIN THE <span>COMMUNITY</span></h2>
  </div>

  <p>Find teammates, chat with players and become part of KB.</p>

  <a href="https://discord.gg/ZnfGRUM6j"
     target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn">
     JOIN THE KB DISCORD
  </a>
</section>

<footer>
  <strong>KB ESPORTS</strong>
  <p>ROCKET LEAGUE SIDESWIPE</p>
  <p>© <span id="year"></span> KB. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.</p>
</footer>

<script>
function toggleMenu() {
  document.getElementById("navlinks").classList.toggle("open");
}

function closeMenu() {
  document.getElementById("navlinks").classList.remove("open");
}

document.getElementById("year").textContent =
  new Date().getFullYear();
</script>

</body>
</html>
